                    "at": "2026-11-01T03:47:28.763Z",
                    "editedAt": null,
                    "body": "Added seven 'Two columns' states to compare: The team; 100 agents, Load more; Stays on full, On demand nearly empty; On demand full, Stays on nearly empty; Nobody stays on yet; Search empties one column; Narrow window, one column. They use rows only with no Rows/Cards toggle. Cards and Rows states stay. The split follows the window width by container query, so a tiled window collapses too; below about 1030 px wide it is one column. Load more uses the production 'Load more agents' button, 12 at a time, also now on the Cards view. The narrow state is a 720 px frame. Verified at 1396 dark and light, 900 px one column, clicked Load more (12 to 24) and Needs you filter.",
