                    "body": "Root cause was in ListingPage in packages/ui, not the draft: the page content could shrink inside the scroller, so the 80 px bottom padding stopped at the scroller's height and the content ran past it. Added shrink-0 there, which fixes every state and every production listing that uses ListingPage. Checked no listing relies on an inner scroll. Measured add-scope-auth, many-rows and columns-many scrolled to the end at 1396: 80 px below the last item, was 0.",
